  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구걸은 어떠한 \n                            재료도 없이 유일하게 지피를 만질 수 있는 스킬입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일반 플레이어에게 \n                            구걸을 하는 것은 뛰어난 화술이 필요 하지만</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">NPC에게 구걸을 \n                            하는 것은 베깅스킬 하나로 구걸을 하실수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">4타일 떨어진데 \n                            까지 베깅이 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구걸스킬을 구동한후 \n                            원하시는 엔피씨를 클릭해주면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"530\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"498\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;구걸 \n                            상세정보</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/beg/beg_3.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"396\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구걸이 \n                            실패하였을 때 나오는 메세지입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/uojobs/beg/beg_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:200/100\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"296\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">NPC가 \n                            수중에 금화가 19-10골드 이하이었을 때</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">나오는 \n                            메시지입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">즉 \n                            1골드를 줍니다-_-;;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/beg/beg_1.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"296\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">NPC가 \n                            100골드 이상을 수중에 가지고 있을 때</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구걸이 \n                            성공하면 10골드를 줍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">90-99는 \n                            9골드,80-89는8골드이런식으로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">구걸한번에 \n                            한번씩 배분을 받습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/uojobs/beg/beg_4.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"296\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">9골드이하일 \n                            때 즉 1골드밑으로 줄 수 없으므로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10px;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">나오는 \n                            메시지 입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;p.s : NPC의 소유지피의 비율에따라 \n                구걸성공시 금화를 획득할 수</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있으므로 스누핑(가방뒤지기)스킬도 올리시면 \n                NPC가 얼마나 많은 금화를 가지고 있는지도</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">알 수 있을 것입니다.NPC는 대부분 NOBLE정도의 \n                페임을 가진 NPC들이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">많은 금화를 가지고 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n"
